{"steam_appid":3512950,"steam_name":"Monterey Jack","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512950/1301152831/cb0aec09e3117e9e3b3da70d7aa10f6bb46cfa39/1766972720/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766973612","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257256447/0ed4d8bc7e30af7b8db919117df9f2ad0a8f8b36/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766973612","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/e1ef295568e877aba16be379d0d902f1b24f806d/ss_e1ef295568e877aba16be379d0d902f1b24f806d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783442057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/c810b5ed6f2c1e25b0fc3f30ad4cf3d666cde239/ss_c810b5ed6f2c1e25b0fc3f30ad4cf3d666cde239.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783442057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/168f563fb5338a1cfe9c8dab4cae3c337ad1cfe8/ss_168f563fb5338a1cfe9c8dab4cae3c337ad1cfe8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783442057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/2be21425b88925901cd5587b1ddd91fd131e5b27/ss_2be21425b88925901cd5587b1ddd91fd131e5b27.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783442057","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/ff60afabfcd836fbc70c954e80d9c5e79d902d67/ss_ff60afabfcd836fbc70c954e80d9c5e79d902d67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783442057"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/14acaaa2fcea1222b89b8ddee2668677.avif?t=1783442057\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> is a game where you're trapped in a cheese factory. Your best friend is missing. And a giant cheese man wants you dead. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILLY WONKA MEETS HELL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/017c99805847a8e7129c4228a5cfd08a.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Drip, drop, the dairy's near, Monterey Jack is what you fear!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monterey Jack</strong> hunts you in real-time. Stay alert, watch your noise meter and follow his cheesy footprints, or risk getting caught off guard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO CUT THE CHEESE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/52b6e5d65f50fc82aa96d7e39ce4a6f2.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jack is not alone. His army of cheese zombies must be chopped into bits!</i> <i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTRUN, OUTSMART, AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.poster.avif?t=1783442057\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.webm?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512950/extras/2d5f6d4a85ad1761c702bc2a3779d581.mp4?t=1783442057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>Enemies have detailed hitboxes, requiring players to find weak spots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>makeshift weapons</strong> such as <strong>slingshots, nail guns, and kitchen knives</strong> to fight a large cast of cheese-born baddies. Enemies react based on where they are hit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MASSIVE CHEESE FACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Travel the cheese river to explore the cheese factory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Monterey Jack</strong> is packed with <strong>terrifying encounters, intense chases, and heart-stopping jump scares.</strong> The game features <strong>multiple endings</strong>, and a<strong> survival mode</strong>: where players have to run from Jack for as long as they can, with their time going up on a Steam <strong>leaderboard</strong>. <br>  </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 or AMD RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> In-game settings to adjust for lower-end machines.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action"],"developers":["DangerousBob Studio LLC"],"publishers":["DangerousBob Studio LLC"],"release_date":"9 Feb, 2026"}